// =====================================================================
// LOCAL-ONLY Workers AI proxy for tools/report-panel. NEVER DEPLOY THIS.
// Start it with `node tools/report-panel/start-proxy.mjs` (wrangler dev on
// 127.0.0.1). It has no auth: anyone who can reach it can spend Workers AI
// on the account. If it is ever deployed by mistake it stays unreachable:
// workers_dev is false, there are no routes, and the Worker rejects every
// request whose Host is not localhost / 127.0.0.1. Delete the deployed
// Worker anyway (`wrangler delete --name report-panel-ai-proxy-local-only`).
// =====================================================================
{
  "name": "report-panel-ai-proxy-local-only",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2025-12-01",
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "ai": { "binding": "AI" }
}
